# Build before push

Before every `git push` from this repo, run:

```bash
npm run typecheck
```

Fix every TypeScript error first. Do not push a failing typecheck. Prefer `typecheck` over a full `next build` unless the change needs a production build check.

Order: change → `npm run typecheck` → commit → push.

Skip only when the user says not to build, or the change is docs/rules-only with no TypeScript.
